    <h2>My Favourite Subjects</h2>

    <ul>

        <li><b>Mathematics</b></li>
        <p>Mathematics helps me develop problem-solving and logical thinking skills. I enjoy solving puzzles, working
            with numbers,
            and learning new methods to answer challenging questions.</p>

        <li><b>Physics</b></li>
        <p>Physics helps me understand the natural world and the laws that govern it. I enjoy conducting experiments and
            solving problems related to motion, energy, and forces.</p>

        <li><b>Accounting</b></li>
        <p>Accounting teaches me how to record, summarize, and report financial information. I find it interesting to
            analyze business transactions and understand their impact on the bottom line.</p>

        <li><b>Economics</b></li>
        <p>Economics helps me understand how markets work, how resources are allocated, and how policies can affect
            economic outcomes. I enjoy exploring real-world applications of economic theories.</p>

        <li><b>Business Studies</b></li>
        <p>Business Studies helps me understand the principles of business management and entrepreneurship. I enjoy
            learning about market strategies, financial planning, and leadership skills.</p>

        <li><b>English</b></li>
        <p>English helps me develop strong communication and critical thinking skills. I enjoy reading literature,
            writing essays, and participating in discussions.</p>

        <li><b>ICT</b></li>
        <p>ICT (Information and Communication Technology) helps me develop digital literacy and technical skills. I
            enjoy learning about software applications, programming, and online research.</p>
    </ul>

